OL,3,GNEWSASection of Metro to close for
OL,4,Atrack replacement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the Tyne and Wear Metro is
OL,7,Fdue to shut for nine days its track is
OL,8,Freplaced.
OL,10,FNexus, which runs the service, is
OL,11,Fshutting the yellow line connecting
OL,12,FNorth Tyneside and Newcastle in both
OL,13,Fdirections between St James and
OL,14,FMonkseaton from 24 October.
OL,16,FBuses will replace trains during the
OL,17,Fclosure, but the operator warned
OL,18,Fpassengers to plan ahead and allow
OL,19,Fextra time for their journey.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
